# Production Deploy

When the user asks to deploy production (for example: "sube prod", "sube produccion", "deploy prod"), follow `DEPLOYMENT.md` and run `deploy-prod.ps1`.

**Primary host is 161** (`161.97.154.152`). Do not deploy to the old 213 host.

Key facts:

- Production domain: `https://www.musicmundial.com/` (news) and `https://www.musicmundial.com/vote/` (voting)
- API: `https://www.musicmundial.com/api` (also `https://vote.musicmundial.com/api` if proxied)
- SSH host: `161.97.154.152`
- SSH port: `2981`
- SSH user: `root`
- Auth: password via `NMM_SSH_PASSWORD` (not the old `vmm_server` key)
- Site root: `/www/wwwroot/new_musicmundial`
- HTML: `/www/wwwroot/new_musicmundial/html`
- Backend: Docker project `new_musicmundial` (`nmm-api`, `nmm-worker`, `nmm-redis`, …)

Architecture:

- Frontend = static build in `html/` (+ `html/vote/`) behind nginx/Apache on 161
- Backend = Docker compose in `/www/wwwroot/new_musicmundial`
- Preserve server `.env` and `uploads/`

Rules:

- Build vote with `VITE_API_BASE_URL=/vote/api` plus Firebase/Turnstile keys from `DEPLOYMENT.md`
- Build news with `npx vite build --config news/vite.config.js` → `dist-news`
- Prefer `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\deploy-prod.ps1`
- Full stack uses `deploy/new_musicmundial/scripts/deploy_contabo.py`
- HTML-only uses `upload_html_161.py`
- After upload, `html/` dirs `755`, files `644`
- Verify: `https://www.musicmundial.com/` 200, `/vote/` 200, `/api/health` ok
